{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Noelle — The heart of the Weird Route\n\nShy, secretly in love with Susie, marked by Dess's disappearance. She's one of the few who notices the player's influence over Kris.","x":-200,"y":-90,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nHer disappearance marked her for life — she froze up spelling 'December' in a contest.","x":-140,"y":-579,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Weird Route**\nThe player pushes her to become 'strong': she steals the Freeze Ring and ends up casting SnowGrave on Berdly.","x":256,"y":-431,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**She recognizes the player's voice**\nOne of the few characters aware that something is controlling Kris from outside.","x":420,"y":-75,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nSecretly in love with her; the bond grows chapter by chapter until it becomes mutual by Ch.4.","x":256,"y":281,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Second hero of the Prophecy**\nShe can equip the Black Shard and ribbons — a design clue, not confirmed in the normal game.","x":-140,"y":429,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Rudy**\nAn extremely close relationship; they play Dragon Blazers III together.","x":-536,"y":281,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Carol**\nA distant relationship — Rudy describes her as 'hard' on Noelle.","x":-700,"y":-75,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"3"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Queen**\nTreats her like a daughter and tries to turn her into her new Knight.","x":-536,"y":-431,"width":280,"height":155,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_ch5","type":"text","text":"**The Lake ending (Ch.5)**\nA deranged smile, shrunken irises — the culmination of her 'sanity slippage'. The point of no return.","x":-900,"y":300,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_dessknight","type":"text","text":"**Is Dess the Roaring Knight?** The antlers, the Black Knife (which resembles a wiffle ball bat, Dess's weapon), and the Gaster-like stigmata are the basis for one of the fandom's biggest theories — without textual confirmation.","x":-900,"y":-900,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_dessknight-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/dess_knight1.png","x":-900,"y":-1130,"width":220,"height":124},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":-1280,"y":-92,"width":95,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-137,"y":-976,"width":91,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Weird_Route_Noelle_Face2.webp","x":539,"y":-713,"width":165,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_talksprite.png","x":810,"y":-105,"width":174,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":552,"y":514,"width":108,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/profecia_paneles_cap4_1/final_gifs/12_the_second_hero_the_girl_with_hope_crossed_on_her_heart.gif","x":-138,"y":791,"width":95,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rudy_Overworld_1.png","x":-818,"y":507,"width":94,"height":190},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_Holiday.webp","x":-1070,"y":-104,"width":87,"height":189},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Queen_deltarune.webp","x":-806,"y":-706,"width":98,"height":190},{"id":"s_ch5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lake.png","x":-1234,"y":446,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s_angel","type":"text","text":"**The Angel of the Prophecy?** A real 2022 ARG clock engraved with her name reads \"the name of the Angel with torn wings\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] — matching the Silver Ring she equips in the game.","x":900,"y":300,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_cyberworld","type":"text","text":"**Who created the Cyber World?** It's assumed to be her, but the \"December\" spelling contest (Dess's real name) suggests it could have been Asriel, who was present after Dess was gone.","x":0,"y":700,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_angel-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":1275,"y":417,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s_usedup","type":"text","text":"**Is she herself just another \"key\"?**\nThe White Cloak (her representation on the Sword Route in Ch.3) gets consumed at a door with the message \"She was used up\" — treating her, literally, as a key that runs out. A highly speculative theory.","x":900,"y":-170,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_usedup-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/noelle_she_was_used_up.png","x":1240,"y":-420,"width":220,"height":150}],"edges":[{"id":"e_dessknight","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_dessknight","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_dessknight-img","fromNode":"s_dessknight-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_dessknight","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s7","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_ch5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s6-img-e","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s7-img-e","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_ch5-img-e","fromNode":"s_ch5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_angel","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_angel","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_cyberworld","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_cyberworld","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_angel-img","fromNode":"s_angel-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_angel","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_usedup","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_usedup","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_usedup-img","fromNode":"s_usedup-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_usedup","toSide":"top","color":"6"}]}